WEBVTT

00:01.884 --> 00:04.052
Someone needs to preemptively
travel to the island

00:04.094 --> 00:06.638
to locate and take down
the man of mystery.

00:06.889 --> 00:09.683
This beauty was made for this.

00:10.976 --> 00:12.143
I'm coming along, too.

00:12.436 --> 00:15.772
<i>Mista! He's already on the radio!</i>

00:20.069 --> 00:21.820
Shoot!

00:22.071 --> 00:23.614
BAZOO

00:25.574 --> 00:26.950
<i>Shit… Dio cane!</i>

00:28.869 --> 00:31.746
<i>I can't let this truck
get away now. Not here.</i>

00:43.634 --> 00:48.134
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

00:48.973 --> 00:52.476
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

00:54.228 --> 00:58.728
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

00:59.400 --> 01:03.237
<i>But I will never give in</i>

01:03.279 --> 01:07.779
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

01:15.082 --> 01:19.582
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

01:28.137 --> 01:32.637
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

01:34.143 --> 01:38.643
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

01:41.191 --> 01:44.360
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

01:44.403 --> 01:48.903
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

01:49.658 --> 01:54.158
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

02:03.797 --> 02:08.297
EPISODE 08
SIX BULLETS APPEARS, PART 2

02:05.674 --> 02:08.782
<i>Guido Mista's outlook on life
has always been simple is best.</i>

02:12.514 --> 02:14.098
<i>He found joy in
the banality of sleep,</i>

02:14.183 --> 02:15.893
<i>in the gentle sway of the branches
in the morning light,</i>

02:15.934 --> 02:18.728
<i>in the smooth creeping
of the clouds,</i>

02:18.771 --> 02:22.441
<i>the aroma of wine,
the texture of formaggio.</i>

02:23.108 --> 02:24.776
<i>He would catch sight
of a beautiful girl</i>

02:24.860 --> 02:26.736
<i>and flirt with gusto,
despite her disapproval.</i>

02:26.904 --> 02:28.363
<i>If he was in need
of pocket money,</i>

02:28.405 --> 02:30.365
<i>he would go to the theater,
waiting for any poor soul</i>

02:30.407 --> 02:32.700
<i>foolish enough to slander
the featured actor,</i>

02:32.743 --> 02:34.578
<i>beating the offender
for every last lira they had</i>

02:35.621 --> 02:37.414
<i>And sometimes,
the beatdown be fell him,</i>

02:37.498 --> 02:40.250
<i>stopping only with
police intervention.</i>

02:40.709 --> 02:44.963
<i>But despite it all,
Mista was happy.</i>

02:47.758 --> 02:51.595
<i>Some might call it
foolish naiveté,</i>

02:51.637 --> 02:53.847
<i>but in the mind of Mista,
it was simple.</i>

02:54.014 --> 02:58.514
<i>Overanalyzing is
the bedfellow of fear.</i>

03:00.312 --> 03:04.812
<i>But when Mista turned seventeen,
something changed him.</i>

03:05.067 --> 03:08.612
<i>He came to the conclusion that
the destiny of every soul is set.</i>

03:09.071 --> 03:11.490
<i>In youth, one may feel
helplessly stuck;</i>

03:11.573 --> 03:14.701
<i>that nothing feels
straightforward or easy,</i>

03:14.743 --> 03:18.621
<i>but in the end, we all travel down
the path we are supposed to take.</i>

03:19.415 --> 03:21.208
<i>It was a clear summer's night,</i>

03:21.250 --> 03:24.795
<i>and Mista was
on his usual passeggiata.</i>

03:25.421 --> 03:26.422
Mista!

03:26.463 --> 03:28.298
Hey, you girls wanna party tonight?

03:28.340 --> 03:30.133
Sorry, we have somewhere to go.

03:30.217 --> 03:31.092
Ciao!

03:31.135 --> 03:31.885
Sure.

03:31.927 --> 03:33.887
No! Let go of me!

03:33.929 --> 03:36.139
I told you it was futile…
Now settle down, slut!

03:41.603 --> 03:43.563
Shut up! Enough squawking!

03:44.606 --> 03:48.318
<i>In the parked car, the woman
lay assaulted, nearly nude.</i>

03:48.986 --> 03:51.071
<i>Blood was gushing from
her nose and mouth,</i>

03:51.113 --> 03:53.073
<i>she was almost unconscious.</i>

03:53.949 --> 03:57.077
<i>The urge to not get involved
was strong, yet…</i>

04:03.000 --> 04:05.002
- Y-You bastard!
<i>- He knew what he had to do…</i>

04:05.043 --> 04:07.420
<i>Instinctively,
his body sprang to action.</i>

04:07.796 --> 04:11.466
Cazzo… Just what do you think
you're doing with my brother?!

04:11.967 --> 04:13.510
Figlio di put tan a!

04:17.055 --> 04:18.848
<i>The distance between shooter
and target maybe minimal,</i>

04:18.891 --> 04:21.685
<i>but a pull of the trigger
does not guarantee a direct hit.</i>

04:21.935 --> 04:24.103
<i>In a state of panic and
momentary fear,</i>

04:24.146 --> 04:28.646
<i>the shooter can easily fire the gun
without having acquired proper aim.</i>

04:29.610 --> 04:31.361
<i>The aggressor let out two shots.</i>

04:31.445 --> 04:35.945
<i>Both bullets grazed Mista's arm
before fading into the darkness.</i>

04:36.867 --> 04:38.034
The hell?!

04:39.995 --> 04:42.205
Get away from me… Hey!

04:43.165 --> 04:46.501
<i>Three, four, five, six!</i>

04:46.835 --> 04:49.879
<i>It was unfathomable. Each bullet
was swallowed up in the darkness.</i>

04:50.798 --> 04:52.925
<i>His accomplices panicked
and fired their guns.</i>

04:53.008 --> 04:55.927
<i>In what can only be
called a miracle,</i>

04:56.011 --> 04:58.221
<i>not a single bullet struck Mista.</i>

04:58.847 --> 05:01.432
<i>Mista was also struck by
his own ability</i>

05:01.517 --> 05:04.019
<i>to maintain a sense of
serene concentration.</i>

05:04.102 --> 05:05.394
What the hell's going on?

05:05.479 --> 05:06.521
Wh-Who is this guy?!

05:06.563 --> 05:08.231
- Bro!
- W-What are you—?

05:08.315 --> 05:12.736
<i>Mista grabbed a gun
and some bullets</i>

05:12.778 --> 05:15.822
<i>and, in a hail of bullets,
coolly loaded the magazine.</i>

05:16.114 --> 05:20.614
<i>Like a nurse sliding the syringe
into a bulging vein,</i>

05:21.203 --> 05:22.621
<i>he pulled the trigger,
calmly and deliberately.</i>

05:23.539 --> 05:25.415
<i>He took aim, the muzzle pointed
squarely at the three men's faces,</i>

05:25.499 --> 05:26.708
<i>and fired four perfect shots.</i>

05:27.376 --> 05:30.712
<i>He had never killed another man
in his life.</i>

05:31.213 --> 05:33.715
<i>Yet he felt no hesitation
nor any regret.</i>

05:34.091 --> 05:36.843
<i>In a moment of hopelessness,</i>

05:36.885 --> 05:38.428
<i>Mista found the strength
to cut through the darkness</i>

05:38.470 --> 05:39.971
<i>that had enveloped his soul.</i>

05:49.147 --> 05:50.189
Muori!

05:53.694 --> 05:56.780
This truck driver must
also be the owner.

05:56.822 --> 05:58.198
It's injury free…

05:58.615 --> 06:00.575
This guy's right leg
is perfectly fine.

06:01.243 --> 06:03.453
You know, I wasn't planning
on offing you, but now…

06:05.831 --> 06:07.874
O-Ow!

06:08.417 --> 06:12.504
Fongoul! You shot me twice,
you piece of shit!

06:12.921 --> 06:14.672
Quit squirming…

06:14.756 --> 06:16.883
Next time, I'll be sure to
take better aim, cazzo!

06:17.259 --> 06:20.178
<i>Geez, what kind of
lame-ass line was that?!</i>

06:20.262 --> 06:22.097
<i>What I should have said is…</i>

06:22.139 --> 06:24.266
<i>"How are you not
a pile of sausage meat?</i>

06:24.308 --> 06:26.351
<i>I shot your ugly mug square on!"</i>

06:26.977 --> 06:30.438
<i>Did the bullet just miss
his brain somehow?</i>

06:30.689 --> 06:34.734
You know, that little effort was
really quite endearing, Mista.

06:35.444 --> 06:39.448
I mean, Mista is what they
call you, right, coglione?

06:39.865 --> 06:41.992
It seems even your friends
are on this beautiful island,

06:42.075 --> 06:43.826
enjoying the sights.

06:43.952 --> 06:47.413
But you're the only one
who's seen my handsome face.

06:47.748 --> 06:48.749
Right, Mista?

06:53.712 --> 06:56.506
You may've got me with
your little radio booby trap and

06:56.548 --> 06:59.217
you may've managed to nail me with
two of your pathetic cheap shots,

06:59.301 --> 07:03.801
but face to face and armed
with my Stand, Arts & Crafts,

07:03.847 --> 07:06.099
I can knock down
any bullet you shoot

07:06.141 --> 07:08.351
from that little gewgaw
you point around.

07:08.602 --> 07:12.564
By the way,
I wasn't really paying attention.

07:12.648 --> 07:16.109
How many bullets
did you shoot off back there, huh?

07:16.568 --> 07:19.195
You fired four on this truck…

07:21.156 --> 07:23.199
And I'm fairly certain you shot off
two of those suckers

07:23.283 --> 07:25.034
back at the marina guard shack.

07:25.369 --> 07:28.622
Right? I did a good job counting,
right, Mista?

07:32.084 --> 07:34.211
Now I can get nice and close

07:34.252 --> 07:37.880
and beat the shit out of you
without a care in the world, right?

07:37.965 --> 07:40.968
<i>Fica… I gotta reload!</i>

07:42.177 --> 07:44.053
W-What the—?!

07:44.137 --> 07:46.722
Goddammit… It's like my hand
is stuck to this thing!

07:46.848 --> 07:48.391
Whoa!

07:49.184 --> 07:51.853
Hey! How long are you
gonna keep driving?!

07:51.895 --> 07:53.187
Hit the breaks, dumb-ass!

07:53.230 --> 07:55.941
Yeah, no kidding… Come here
and help me stop this thing.

07:56.358 --> 07:59.736
Seriously, you gotta help me.
It's outta control…

08:00.028 --> 08:01.946
Think about it for a sec.

08:02.030 --> 08:04.407
Now why do you think
I went through all that trouble

08:04.449 --> 08:06.409
to tell you that
you were out of ammo?

08:06.493 --> 08:08.244
Because I'm a charitable guy?

08:08.537 --> 08:09.746
Mista…

08:09.830 --> 08:12.040
You'll crash and burn
with this truck,

08:12.082 --> 08:13.750
so I was happy to have obliged.

08:14.584 --> 08:17.253
Oh, and your driver can't release
his foot from the gas.

08:17.295 --> 08:19.588
His hands aren't going
anywhere either.

08:19.881 --> 08:22.592
I'm telling you all this
also knowing that reloading

08:22.676 --> 08:25.804
with that left hand fixed to
the truck is an impossibility.

08:31.852 --> 08:34.938
<i>Those are the bullets
that bastardo's Stand deflected</i>

08:35.063 --> 08:38.357
<i>They're frozen in mid air,
like in suspended animation,</i>

08:38.400 --> 08:40.443
<i>moving in tandem with the truck.</i>

08:40.819 --> 08:41.903
<i>Frozen…</i>

08:42.195 --> 08:45.781
<i>He must've immobilized
the bullets with his power.</i>

08:45.907 --> 08:48.618
<i>That's how he cemented the driver
and me to this freakin' truck.</i>

08:49.077 --> 08:51.120
<i>His ability is to transfix objects</i>

08:51.163 --> 08:53.582
<i>in exactly the place
he touches them.</i>

08:53.749 --> 08:57.294
<i>That's why my bullet never made it
past the skin on his forehead</i>

08:57.377 --> 08:58.961
<i>It was just a surface wound</i>

08:59.046 --> 09:00.547
<i>Of course he didn't
croak back there!</i>

09:01.214 --> 09:03.299
To tell you the truth, Mista,

09:03.425 --> 09:07.387
I couldn't be happier
that you went after me.

09:07.596 --> 09:09.472
In fact, I'm so happy,

09:09.514 --> 09:12.141
I'm willing to let go of
the little scratch you gave me.

09:12.434 --> 09:14.686
I mean,
no one knew for sure whether

09:14.770 --> 09:17.773
the great treasure of Polpo
even existed.

09:18.023 --> 09:19.107
It's always been just a rumor

09:19.149 --> 09:20.900
down-and-out punks
liked to throw around.

09:21.401 --> 09:23.152
But your fabulous decision
to kill me

09:23.236 --> 09:25.321
just proves the rumors
are really true!

09:26.740 --> 09:31.240
You, my friend, just gave me hope
and a reason to live! Yahoo!

09:31.411 --> 09:34.747
I'm gonna savor every moment
of swiping that lira

09:34.790 --> 09:37.334
from that cretino Bucciarati!

09:44.466 --> 09:47.552
I already told you I can knock down
your petty bullets

09:47.636 --> 09:49.804
like the pieces of shit they are!

09:51.640 --> 09:53.683
- Yee-haw!
- Yee-haw!

09:53.725 --> 09:56.644
<i>W-What?! He was hiding
another bullet in the shadows?</i>

09:56.686 --> 09:58.854
<i>He fired two bullets
in a single shot?</i>

09:58.897 --> 10:01.274
<i>Is that Mista's Stand?</i>

10:01.566 --> 10:02.650
<i>But…</i>

10:02.692 --> 10:04.568
<i>I still have a chance to
work my magic!</i>

10:08.907 --> 10:09.908
- Hell yeah!
- Hell yeah!

10:10.075 --> 10:14.454
Excellent work, Six Bullets
Number 6 and Number 7!

10:14.496 --> 10:17.248
And now that we got rid
of your fugly ass,

10:17.958 --> 10:20.377
our worries just became road kill!

10:23.839 --> 10:28.339
Ow! You got me again,
you mother…!

10:30.178 --> 10:32.471
I swear… you're gonna die.

10:32.514 --> 10:35.892
This is for ten billion!
I promise, you're gonna die!

10:36.643 --> 10:39.062
I know there's a way
to beat this bastard.

10:39.104 --> 10:43.233
But he's a tough one…
There's no doubt about that.

10:43.358 --> 10:44.734
Guess it's time to dig deep.

10:50.532 --> 10:52.617
SALE
ARTS & CRAFTS

10:54.369 --> 10:55.370
Blood…

10:59.374 --> 11:00.583
A vehicle…

11:01.293 --> 11:03.420
The enemy and Mista must be
in some kind of car.

11:03.503 --> 11:05.421
They're heading to higher ground.

11:06.381 --> 11:08.424
Will it even matter
if I go after them now?

11:08.592 --> 11:09.384
Stop it, Giorno.

11:09.426 --> 11:11.553
What matters now is getting a car
that will allow you to find them.

11:13.930 --> 11:15.431
Four bullets?

11:15.599 --> 11:17.809
What the hell's going on?

11:17.893 --> 11:19.853
I only have four bullets!

11:19.895 --> 11:22.230
But it doesn't make
any freakin' sense…

11:22.272 --> 11:23.523
Huh? Hey!

11:23.565 --> 11:26.651
Mista, it's because
you dropped one! Jeez Iouise!

11:26.735 --> 11:28.027
You dropped the bullet! Shit!

11:28.069 --> 11:30.821
You of all people should know
the number four is bad news.

11:30.906 --> 11:33.116
You can't load four bullets
into the gun! You can't!

11:33.158 --> 11:34.659
It's gonna be bad.

11:37.454 --> 11:39.247
My hands are finally free!

11:39.289 --> 11:40.665
Thank god! My feet can move, too!

11:40.749 --> 11:42.959
- I can finally stop this thing!
- Don't even think it!

11:44.044 --> 11:47.797
Huh? But moments ago, you were
screaming at me to stop this thing!

11:47.881 --> 11:50.133
Well, I changed my mind,
so you're gonna have to deal.

11:50.217 --> 11:52.052
Now be a good driver
and listen to what I say.

11:52.385 --> 11:55.304
Okay, I want you to take me
to Marina Grande.

11:55.722 --> 11:57.390
I've got a friend waiting
for me there.

11:57.432 --> 11:59.600
Isn't there another way
to get there?

11:59.768 --> 12:02.103
Look, I promise I won't do
anything to hurt you.

12:02.145 --> 12:04.313
I'll even make it up to you
when we get back.

12:04.481 --> 12:05.482
Got it?!

12:06.524 --> 12:09.985
<i>My bullets go only skin deep
with this bastard</i>

12:10.070 --> 12:11.946
<i>I can't inflict any major damage.</i>

12:12.530 --> 12:14.323
<i>Quest Stand del cazzo…</i>

12:14.449 --> 12:16.159
<i>How do I best this guy?</i>

12:16.660 --> 12:19.371
<i>If I can just get
a bulletin his mouth…</i>

12:19.454 --> 12:21.456
<i>He can't defend himself
from the inside out.</i>

12:21.539 --> 12:22.957
<i>It might actually kill him.</i>

12:23.041 --> 12:25.835
<i>But I only have four bullets left.</i>

12:25.877 --> 12:28.129
<i>Shit, I just had to get stuck
with a jinxed number!</i>

12:28.171 --> 12:29.964
<i>Three would've been
a helluva lot better.</i>

12:30.632 --> 12:32.925
<i>Now I know what he looks like
and how he fights.</i>

12:32.968 --> 12:35.011
<i>I don't need to be flirting
with danger anymore.</i>

12:35.053 --> 12:39.057
<i>I'll head back to the harbor
and reconvene with Giorno.</i>

12:39.140 --> 12:42.226
<i>I have a bunch of
extra ammo back there too.</i>

12:53.154 --> 12:54.697
<i>Th-That bastard!</i>

12:54.823 --> 12:57.742
<i>What the hell?
He climbed the freakin' cliff?!</i>

12:57.826 --> 12:58.868
Hey, stop the truck!

12:58.910 --> 13:00.536
Huh? Now what?

13:00.620 --> 13:02.204
Stop the truck, I said!

13:02.414 --> 13:03.706
Just do what I say!

13:05.834 --> 13:08.461
It's that guy again!

13:16.094 --> 13:17.428
Mista…

13:17.512 --> 13:20.139
You're even dumber than you look
if you think

13:20.181 --> 13:23.142
I'm gonna let you waltz off and
tell your friends all about me!

13:32.277 --> 13:35.989
You're never getting away, Mista!

13:36.197 --> 13:40.697
<i>So he can hold rocks in the air
just like he did the bullets?</i>

13:40.952 --> 13:43.955
<i>He used those things like a ladder
to get all the way up here then.</i>

13:44.372 --> 13:46.624
Why the hell did you stop
the truck now, shit for brains?!

13:46.708 --> 13:48.292
- Huh?
- Drive!

13:48.376 --> 13:49.752
Huh, wha—?! Huh?

13:49.919 --> 13:51.712
I mean step on it, idiot!

13:51.755 --> 13:53.381
Stop, and I'll punish you
so freakin' hard!

13:56.009 --> 13:58.261
If this is how you wanna
settle things…

13:58.553 --> 14:00.096
Then come and get some!

14:04.768 --> 14:08.062
Hey, dick face, drive that truck
like your life depends on it!

14:08.188 --> 14:10.899
Just gotta tap it slightly
with my finger…

14:10.940 --> 14:13.609
You'd be surprised what
a little steady tapping can do.

14:13.693 --> 14:17.613
Power tends to accumulate
at the point of fixation.

14:17.739 --> 14:20.116
It's best not to strike
at full tilt.

14:20.200 --> 14:22.619
Proper aim becomes unattainable,

14:22.660 --> 14:25.788
thus projecting to one's opponent
the vector of one's projectile.

14:25.914 --> 14:27.957
Finally… you must release!

14:28.458 --> 14:30.460
BAM

14:29.584 --> 14:30.481
What?!

14:40.887 --> 14:43.306
It came back to you, Mista.

14:45.767 --> 14:50.267
Looks like your three little Stands
are a bit unruly.

14:52.732 --> 14:54.150
Just little by little…

14:54.275 --> 14:57.903
With the slightest force…
tap after little tap…

14:58.238 --> 15:01.866
It's a lot like entering S.O.S.
in Morse code.

15:02.117 --> 15:04.077
The aim's not perfect,

15:04.119 --> 15:06.830
and it's not great on things
that can't seem to stay still,

15:06.871 --> 15:10.374
but the time is right
to nail you now!

15:10.458 --> 15:12.877
<i>Of course, I'm in this shit mess…</i>

15:12.961 --> 15:14.420
<i>My luck is totally shot.</i>

15:14.587 --> 15:17.214
<i>Four is never a good thing.</i>

15:17.298 --> 15:19.341
<i>It's been that way ever since
I was a kid…</i>

15:19.426 --> 15:23.012
<i>You never know what
the consequences are gonna be.</i>

15:23.638 --> 15:27.350
<i>But the other numbers
are just dandy</i>

15:27.434 --> 15:29.352
<i>I've got one shot left,</i>

15:29.436 --> 15:32.856
<i>which must mean
the worst is behind me, right?</i>

15:32.939 --> 15:35.775
<i>I got lucky number one.
Eat shit and die, bitch!</i>

15:35.817 --> 15:38.820
Number 5! Number 6!
Forces unite!

15:38.862 --> 15:40.864
Together,
we can blast this bastard!

15:40.905 --> 15:43.782
This is all we got.
Let's make it count, guys!

15:43.992 --> 15:44.993
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

15:46.119 --> 15:48.162
Pipe down, signore, Mista!

15:48.204 --> 15:50.873
Your trigger happy days
are over, moron!

15:51.124 --> 15:54.877
I don't care what
your bullet-riding stooges can do,

15:54.919 --> 15:56.211
or how many of them
you shoot at me,

15:56.254 --> 15:59.006
at this distance,
I can do whatever the hell I want.

15:59.340 --> 16:01.925
I can protect myself and
have time to spare!

16:02.010 --> 16:03.386
You should know by now

16:03.470 --> 16:05.847
that it's utterly impossible
to best me, right, Mista?

16:05.889 --> 16:07.724
If I told you…

16:07.765 --> 16:10.517
that I only have one bullet left
in this chamber,

16:10.560 --> 16:11.852
would you believe me?

16:12.312 --> 16:14.272
I'm not shitting you.

16:14.355 --> 16:16.523
I got one shot left.

16:16.691 --> 16:20.027
If I shoot, and you manage
to knock it down,

16:20.069 --> 16:23.072
I'll be out of bullets.

16:23.448 --> 16:24.574
You'll find out sooner or later,

16:24.657 --> 16:26.408
so I might as well
come out with it.

16:26.534 --> 16:30.246
If I screw up this last shot,
there'll be no question,

16:30.330 --> 16:33.624
you'll find out that
I'm clear out of ammo!

16:36.377 --> 16:38.087
But of course it's pure speculation

16:38.129 --> 16:40.089
as to whether
I will really screw up…

16:40.131 --> 16:43.926
The reality is
I'm gonna kill your ass!

16:44.385 --> 16:47.763
Why do you insist on barfing out
this bullshit, Mista?

16:47.889 --> 16:51.976
How many bullets you have
has no implications for me.

16:52.060 --> 16:54.437
You can shoot one or
a hundred of those things.

16:54.521 --> 16:56.773
You'll never be able to defeat me!

16:56.981 --> 16:59.400
I can assure you
that wasn't bullshit.

17:00.193 --> 17:03.237
There's no question
you will drop your guard.

17:03.321 --> 17:05.990
You already know that I only have
one bullet to my name.

17:06.574 --> 17:08.200
This is bullshit and you know it.

17:12.247 --> 17:14.207
He's gonna use his Stand!

17:14.249 --> 17:15.208
Leave it to me!

17:15.250 --> 17:17.126
Here we go…
We've got one target!

17:17.210 --> 17:18.711
Put your back into it!

17:20.713 --> 17:23.006
<i>You're aiming for
the inside of my mouth.</i>

17:23.091 --> 17:24.175
<i>Am I wrong?</i>

17:24.884 --> 17:26.677
He just opened his mouth
for us just like that!

17:26.761 --> 17:28.304
He's wide open guys!

17:28.429 --> 17:30.139
We've gotta drive it home now!

17:41.734 --> 17:43.360
I knew it.

17:48.324 --> 17:49.658
Ow!

17:50.451 --> 17:52.953
I knew that's exactly
where you'd aim…

17:53.037 --> 17:54.663
I knew you'd go for my mouth!

17:55.707 --> 17:58.000
That's what anyone else
would think…

17:58.459 --> 18:00.377
That my power
to anchor objects in space

18:00.461 --> 18:02.379
would be rendered useless
inside my mouth.

18:04.632 --> 18:06.717
Defending against attacks
is such a pain,

18:06.801 --> 18:09.470
so I thought I might as well
open my mouth for you!

18:09.804 --> 18:10.679
No freakin' way…

18:10.722 --> 18:14.350
He can even stop a bullet
in that mouth of his?

18:15.310 --> 18:19.314
Damn… This hurts like a mother!

18:20.440 --> 18:23.317
Well, I guess you were
really telling the truth

18:23.359 --> 18:25.652
about your one last little bullet.

18:26.321 --> 18:29.198
You don't seem so eager
to shoot now.

18:29.324 --> 18:32.535
What happened to that
can-do spirit, Mista?

18:32.577 --> 18:35.079
If that's really all you got…

18:35.371 --> 18:37.706
The firepower on this beauty…

18:42.003 --> 18:45.047
is topped up and ready
for launch, Mista!

18:45.131 --> 18:49.093
Eat this… Bombs away!

18:52.138 --> 18:54.557
He really did let down
his guard.

18:54.599 --> 18:57.310
He knew Mista was outta ammo,
so he let down his guard!

18:57.352 --> 19:00.271
You know what they say,
the closer the better.

19:00.355 --> 19:03.983
Up close, our aim is even better!

19:04.150 --> 19:05.860
<i>W-What?!</i>

19:05.902 --> 19:08.321
<i>W-When did they–?</i>

19:08.363 --> 19:10.531
<i>Shit! They're too close!</i>

19:11.366 --> 19:15.370
Giddy up and go, fellas!

19:16.537 --> 19:17.579
Aim!

19:18.956 --> 19:20.749
Arts & Crafts! Guard activate!

19:21.834 --> 19:23.293
<i>He split the thing in two?!</i>

19:25.129 --> 19:27.798
<i>I know I can take
another direct hit.</i>

19:27.882 --> 19:28.757
<i>But there's no way…</i>

19:28.800 --> 19:31.219
<i>He couldn't be aiming for that,
could he?</i>

19:32.011 --> 19:33.303
<i>Holy shit, he can't.</i>

19:33.513 --> 19:36.557
<i>There's no way…
Is he really shooting for that?!</i>

19:36.683 --> 19:37.684
<i>His target is–</i>

19:47.902 --> 19:50.571
I aimed for the same bullet hole
I made in you earlier.

19:50.738 --> 19:52.364
You see, by firing another bullet

19:52.407 --> 19:55.034
directly at the one currently
lodged in your skull,

19:55.076 --> 19:57.286
you can transfix that puppy
all you want,

19:57.328 --> 20:00.331
it's going into your brain, bro!

20:02.917 --> 20:06.921
Now if that doesn't kill you,
then I guess I'm really screwed…

20:30.361 --> 20:32.112
- We did it!
- We did it!

20:32.280 --> 20:33.155
- Yes!
- Yes!

20:33.239 --> 20:34.240
- Yes!
- Yes!

20:37.493 --> 20:39.453
Come on, Number 3.

20:39.495 --> 20:43.207
I told you to stop badgering
Number 5, jeez…

20:49.046 --> 20:53.383
Wow, he's still hanging on,
and with a bullet to the brain.

20:53.593 --> 20:56.345
Guess your Stand
really is invincible.

20:56.471 --> 21:00.971
Bucciarati told me
not to kill you, but…

21:01.934 --> 21:04.561
Hey, we're going back!
Take me back to the harbor now!

21:04.645 --> 21:06.063
What is wrong with you?!

21:06.189 --> 21:10.359
What the hell are you guys
doing up there?!

21:27.960 --> 21:29.461
Vaffanculo.

21:30.171 --> 21:31.797
Who the hell do they think I am?

21:31.839 --> 21:34.091
First, he begs me to stop,
then he screams step on it…

21:34.217 --> 21:36.302
This isn't some taxi, stronzo!

21:36.385 --> 21:38.011
You don't threaten me!

21:38.054 --> 21:39.680
I'll let you off easy this time,

21:39.722 --> 21:42.307
but if I ever see you again,
you can bet it will hurt!

21:43.017 --> 21:45.436
Sorry to be abrupt,
but I'm after somebody.

21:45.520 --> 21:49.607
Could you please take me
to the top of the island?

21:52.318 --> 21:54.528
Quit dilly dallying!
This is serious!

21:54.570 --> 21:56.238
Now I know you will cooperate!

21:58.241 --> 21:59.575
Y-Yes, sir…

23:38.299 --> 23:42.052
EPISODE 09
THE FIRST MISSION FROM THE BOSS
